    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "La̱a̱t Kuɔth",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ɣän, dämaari, /cä bi ruac kɛ yɛ ce̱tkɛ ji̱ yieekä, kä bä ruac kɛ yɛ ce̱tkɛ ji̱ ri̱eŋ, ce̱tkɛ ruɔri ti tɔatni rɛy Kritho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɣän cä yɛ ruëëth kɛ cak, a /ci mɔ a mi̱eth mi dɔk, kɛ ɣöö /ka̱nɛ rɔ̱ rialikä kɛ kui̱dɛ. Kä a cäŋɛ ɛn täämɛ, /ken yɛn rɔ̱ ni rialikä, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kɛ ɣöö ŋuɔtdɛ ala ji̱ ri̱eŋ. Kä min ŋot tiɛɛl kɛnɛ gak kamnikun, /ci yɛn a ji̱ ri̱eŋ, kä ciëŋɛ kɛ ciaŋ nath? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö mi lar ram kɛl ɛ i̱, “Ɛ ɣän raan Puɔl,” kä laar ram mi dɔ̱diɛn ɛ i̱, “Ɛ ɣän raan A-pɔ-löth,” /ci yɛn cieŋ kɛ pek ciɛŋä nath?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä A-pɔ-löth ɛŋa? Kä Puɔl ɛŋa? Kɛ ji̱ läätdä ti ca yɛ nööŋ ŋäthä ce̱tkɛ min ci Kuäär ɛ ka̱m ramɔ i̱ bɛ la̱t. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɣän cä pi̱eth, kä ci A-pɔ-löth kɛ wac, kä ci Kuoth kɛ jakä pith. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ɛnɔ, /ciɛ pi̱i̱th kiɛ wääc ɛnɔ tee luɔt ɔ, ɛ jɛn Kuoth kärɔa min jakɛ kä pith. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ram mi pi̱i̱th kɛnɛ ram mi wääc päärkɛ, kä bi ramɔ mucdɛ jek kɛ pek la̱tdɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö kɛ kɔn la̱a̱t Kuɔth ti lät kɛɛl. Kä kɛ yɛn kak Kuɔth, kä kɛ yɛn ti̱c Kuɔth bä.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ce̱tkɛ puɔ̱th baaŋ Kuɔth in cɛ ka̱m ɣä, cä keŋ rialikä ce̱tkɛ läät mi kuur, kä lät radɔ̱diɛn wi̱cdɛ. A ramɔ nik la̱t in lätdɛ ni jɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö thilɛ ram mi dee keŋ täth a /ci mɔ a min ca la̱t ni wen. Keŋ ɛmɔ ɛ jɛn Yecu Kritho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Täämɛ mi cuŋ raan luaak wi̱i̱ keŋä kɛ da̱a̱p, kiɛ ciɛk in bo̱r, kiɛ pääm ti di̱t kökdiɛn, kiɛ jiɛn, juaac, kiɛ nyon, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bi la̱t raamɔ jɔɔc. Kɛ ɣöö bi cäŋ luɔ̱k ɛ nyoth kɛɛliw, kä ba jɛ nyoth kɛ mac, kä bi mac lät tin ca lat ɛ ram ɛmɔ ɣɔ̱n. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mi bi min ca täth wi̱i̱ keŋä ɛmɔ ŋot kɛ cuɔ̱ŋ, bi ram in tääth jɛ muc jek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mi ca min ca täth waaŋ, bi tääth la̱tdɛ bath, ba kän ni tääth kärɔa, ce̱tkɛ mi känɛ kɛ mac.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yɛn /cia jɛ ŋäc, ɛn ɣöö lapɛ luaak Kuɔth, kä cieŋ Yiëë Kuɔth rɛydun? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mi yär raan luaak Kuɔth bi Kuoth ram ɛmɔ däk, kɛ ɣöö luaak Kuɔth rɛlɛ rɔ, kä kɛ yɛn luaak Kuɔth ɛmɔ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yɛn /cuarɛ rɔ met. Mi caar raan ɛ i̱ pɛlɛ ɛn runi ti̱ti̱, a jɛ la dɔ̱a̱r kɛ ɣöö bɛ pɛl kɛ thuɔ̱k. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö pɛl ɣɔaa ɛmɛ ɛ dɔ̱ɔ̱r kä Kuɔth. Kɛ ɣöö ca jɛ gɔ̱r i̱,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
